1
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:29,380
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,920
[Episode 13]

3
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,290
You remember everything now, don't you?

4
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:37,200
You...

5
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,470
