7
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:47,070
Marry him! Marry him!

8
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:08,039
Director Lin.

9
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,400
How wonderful.

10
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,610
An old dream of the Republican era.

11
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:20,039
Memories of a past life.

12
00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:24,770
Let go of her hands!

13
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,440
Ning Changyue.

14
00:01:32,009 --> 00:01:33,200
Commander Ning.

15
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:39,960
Baiwei and I were engaged.

16
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,110
This is between the two of us.

17
00:01:48,170 --> 00:01:49,170
Engaged?

18
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:51,490
When?

19
00:01:51,979 --> 00:01:53,030
Is it now?

20
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:55,000
♪ So here is to you ♪

21
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,680
Forget about your

22
00:01:57,550 --> 00:02:00,550
♪ My darling ♪

23
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,120
fragmented memories.

24
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:02,280
Song Baiwei?

25
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,950
♪ And here is to you ♪

26
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,070
Song Baiwei is just

27
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:07,510
