for Zhaoxi Newspaper.

30
00:02:09,490 --> 00:02:12,480
♪ Here is to you ♪

31
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:13,260
Do you know why
she was called Song Baiwei?

32
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:16,220
♪ My lover ♪

33
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,870
Because when she painted,

34
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:18,410
