39
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,250
Three thousand years?

40
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:43,590
♪ So when the fire are burning ♪

41
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,810
You don't know?

42
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:41,710
Before this,

43
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,030
she was called Ningjia,

44
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:44,190
Qingwu,

45
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:46,280
and dozens or hundreds of other names.

46
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:52,550
♪ And when the light fades away ♪

47
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,280
The days she was called Song Baiwei

48
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,400
were just an insignificant moment

49
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:52,840
in her long life.

50
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:59,700
♪ When the sky is falling ♪

51
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:07,820
♪ I'll never let you be alone ♪

52
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:03,870
So what if it's a moment?

53
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,870
I can treat her well in every life.

54
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,190
I can love her in every life.

55
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:13,560
I can give her a moment in every life.

56
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,520
What is this?

57
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,600
A destiny of many lifetimes?

58
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:21,710
You...

59
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,240
Open your eyes and see clearly.

60
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,120
Do you see it?

61
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,800
She and I are the same kind of people.

62
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,680
For 3,000 years,

63
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,280
she has been my wife.

64
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:42,000
And she will only be my wife.

65
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:47,079
And your ecstatic reunion

66
00:03:44,930 --> 00:03:49,280
♪ So here is to you ♪

67
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:48,750
is nothing but

68
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:52,360
