74
00:03:57,850 --> 00:04:00,570
♪ My friend ♪

75
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:05,070
♪ Here is to you ♪

76
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:05,910
Song Baiwei is me.

77
00:04:05,570 --> 00:04:08,630
♪ My lover ♪

78
00:04:09,050 --> 00:04:10,700
Song Yiqiu is also me.

79
00:04:09,350 --> 00:04:18,880
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

80
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,120
They are all my names.

81
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:17,160
They are just my names.

82
00:04:22,870 --> 00:04:24,600
Ning Changyue, you haven't changed at all.

83
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:37,950
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

84
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:28,160
Song Yiqiu!

85
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,870
Come on.

86
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,000
Tell me what happened.

87
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,390
Is that your new romance?

88
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:49,800
No.

89
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:52,190
He is the director
of the Autumn Art Gallery,

90
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:53,240
an

91
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,560
old friend of mine.

92
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,000
I owe him something.

93
00:04:58,030 --> 00:04:59,440
I can't pay it back now,

94
00:04:59,990 --> 00:05:01,400
so I can only hide.

95
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,190
Then,

96
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,360
isn't Mr. Ning jealous?

97
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,010
He...

98
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,510
He's not jealous.

99
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:12,380
He just uses wounds to prove

100
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,720
that I belong to him.

101
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:17,190
Forget it.

102
00:05:17,990 --> 00:05:19,120
Just an ex-husband.

103
00:05:20,910 --> 00:05:22,230
Do you often

104
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,690
run away from home like this

105
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,920
and give Mr. Ning the cold shoulder?

106
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,480
This is nothing.

107
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,430
We've done this before.

108
00:05:32,270 --> 00:05:34,310
I think the longest time before

109
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,040
was 70 or 80 years.

110
00:05:37,550 --> 00:05:39,720
I mean 70 or 80 months.

111
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:44,490
What's wrong?

112
00:05:45,670 --> 00:05:46,750
I just feel

113
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:49,680
you guys are wasting too much time.

114
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,150
I used to

115
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,850
have someone I loved very much too.

116
00:05:56,270 --> 00:05:58,470
I thought we would be together forever.

117
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,210
But later,

118
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,460
there was an accident,

119
00:06:03,190 --> 00:06:04,320
and she passed away.

120
00:06:08,690 --> 00:06:09,860
Dr. Xie.

121
00:06:11,650 --> 00:06:12,560
So,

122
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,810
