123
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:17,610
You should cherish
the time with your loved one.

124
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,690
I don't even know

125
00:06:27,710 --> 00:06:29,440
if we're still lovers anymore.

126
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,750
I'm afraid that getting back together

127
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:35,080
will just be repeating the same mistakes.

128
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,830
Then tell him.

129
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,800
Tell him you're hurting.

130
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:43,800
If you don't change, face it, or solve it,

131
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,960
