My finger slipped.

153
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,130
Okay, your finger slipped.

154
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:12,120
But this person is a professional.

155
00:09:23,780 --> 00:09:24,910
She's a little liar.

156
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,730
This is Lin Huai's birth chart.

157
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:31,150
I want you to find every one

158
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:32,440
