163
00:09:47,190 --> 00:09:50,160
But you've found the right person.

164
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:52,240
Five hundred to sever one.

165
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,380
My uncle is not short of money.

166
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:54,440
Start the reading.

167
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:55,670
This, this, this...

168
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:56,320
I... I'll pay for it.

169
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,980
I'll pay. Don't worry, Uncle.

