231
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,030
Decades ago?

232
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,270
Could it be...

233
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,870
Today at 6:45 PM,

234
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,510
at the third alley west of Xiafei Road,

235
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,120
someone fired a gun in the street.

236
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,200
Their aim was deadly accurate.

237
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,060
And their methods were ruthless.

238
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,040
Commander Ning, I am innocent.

239
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:23,140
I swear to God,

240
00:12:23,310 --> 00:12:26,640
