during the suppression of the students.

241
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:28,870
But that gun came from your patrol team.

242
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,240
My man,

243
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,240
in my territory,

244
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,120
was assassinated on the street,

245
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,720
and students were injured.

246
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,270
Tell me,

247
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,840
who should I hold accountable?

248
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:45,150
Commander.

249
00:12:45,150 --> 00:12:46,320
These are not our men.

250
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,630
It must be the Japanese or the Green Gang.

251
00:12:47,630 --> 00:12:48,510
They want to frame us.

252
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,310
Whoever it is,

253
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,390
it happened in your jurisdiction.

254
00:12:51,390 --> 00:12:53,250
I will only hold you accountable.

255
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,790
I give you 24 hours

256
00:12:56,510 --> 00:12:58,240
to find them.

257
00:12:58,670 --> 00:12:59,510
Yes, Sir.

258
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:19,390
Run! Run!

259
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,120
I won't marry him! I won't marry him!

260
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,440
Let me go!

261
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,550
I won't marry him!

262
00:13:36,550 --> 00:13:38,120
Song Yiqiu! Song Yiqiu!

263
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,480
Let me go!

264
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:40,810
Let go!

265
00:13:48,570 --> 00:13:49,690
Hurry!

266
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,000
Let's go!

267
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:52,750
Let's go!

268
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:53,840
I can't walk.

269
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,630
Leave me alone and go!

270
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,040
No.

271
00:14:04,450 --> 00:14:05,330
Burn her!

272
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,200
Burn this witch!

273
00:14:14,070 --> 00:14:14,880
Witch!

274
00:14:15,150 --> 00:14:16,120
Go away!

275
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:17,580
Stay away!

276
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,720
Stay away!

277
00:14:20,510 --> 00:14:21,460
Go away!

278
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:27,300
Qiu.

279
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,970
I worked hard
to climb to this position today

280
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:34,750
just so you wouldn't get hurt anymore.

281
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:50,260
Commander Ning,

282
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:52,240
the 5 patrolmen who killed
the students on the street yesterday

283
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,370
have been arrested.

284
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:56,390
They said in order to disperse
the rioting students as soon as possible,

285
00:14:56,390 --> 00:14:57,720
