286
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,850
and injured people.

287
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:00,570
This is their signed confession.

288
00:15:00,570 --> 00:15:01,370
That was fast.

289
00:15:11,110 --> 00:15:12,390
Injuring people in the street.

290
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:14,390
Abusing power to kill the innocent.

291
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,280
If it wasn't her,

292
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:18,680
someone else innocent would have died.

293
00:15:19,310 --> 00:15:21,840
Dismiss these 5 people
and investigate them.

294
00:15:22,210 --> 00:15:23,670
Dismiss and investigate?

295
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,370
Nothing.

296
00:15:35,550 --> 00:15:38,340
[Commander Ning Kills 5 Innocent
Patrol Officers to Avenge His Wife]

297
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,000
Explain.

298
00:15:43,550 --> 00:15:45,210
Explain that you didn't know.

299
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,820
Explain that you did so to protect me.

300
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,550
Explain that they were in the wrong,

301
00:15:49,550 --> 00:15:51,350
and you just did the right thing.

302
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,720
Explain it!

303
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:56,900
Treating human lives like weeds.

304
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:58,230
Abusing your power.

305
00:15:58,630 --> 00:16:01,240
Is this your so-called protection?

306
00:16:06,930 --> 00:16:09,260
Commander, why didn't you explain?

307
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,750
It was clearly that police chief
who, to close the case,

308
00:16:10,750 --> 00:16:13,150
tortured and killed those 5 patrolmen.

309
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:15,240
You have even been
protecting those students.

310
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,840
It's not what Madam thinks.

311
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,940
I didn't kill them,

312
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,770
yet they died because of me.

313
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:23,310
It has already happened.

314
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:26,230
There's no need to explain.

315
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,240
You still have the nerve to come here?

316
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,200
Get out!

317
00:16:36,810 --> 00:16:38,940
Coming here with your fake apologies.

318
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,760
You have no conscience!

319
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:42,640
You will die a horrible death!

320
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:57,720
Commander.

321
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,380
Don't take it to heart.

322
00:16:59,630 --> 00:17:01,430
These people don't understand.

323
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:14,859
♪ Can I drift away like this? ♪

324
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:20,220
♪ Sink beneath the waves ♪

325
00:17:28,010 --> 00:17:31,720
♪ I close my eyes tight ♪

326
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,510
Go away!

327
00:17:30,830 --> 00:17:32,070
Go away!

328
00:17:32,590 --> 00:17:34,510
What are you doing here?

329
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:36,840
♪ I weigh every vow again and again ♪

330
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,920
Give my family back to me!

331
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:42,550
How are a widow
and her child supposed to survive?

332
00:17:44,410 --> 00:17:47,900
♪ Can I drift away like this? ♪

333
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:52,970
♪ Sink beneath the waves ♪

334
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:03,390
♪ I close my eyes tight ♪

335
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,110
Commander, this is the last household.

336
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:17,240
They're the family of Granny Chen,
who came to the commander's residence

337
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,360
to file a complaint.

338
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,920
She passed away from grief 2 days ago.

339
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:23,310
Only her youngest daughter is left.

340
00:18:41,570 --> 00:18:43,220
Leave the things at the door.

341
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:44,910
I'm not here to deliver things.
